      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `f41a85c07f50a79aa9aa098fb490415c7d01a33b68b1d4cfa02d06864a76d7a9--45100do001_2009.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2009\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | b89343cd916857884515a4e8708cce14d984634d3b0aeeeff19d212cc3b4b01e | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | d6fd2e58ccd1bd70e28296e8065811059a42a33d0483fd8c32bd47aa14db7739 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 00891f1e6d23f8049c3b0e409a7501adeccf1c22f60e081933bb51eef78bf34e | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | eafef652117d61a8fce343f71eac319719acbabc7589cfe0a3b2a68dbd357eb1 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | e6c7da6e5b4bf1e23d72c4609d7fb9945ac8449c3d5794cc66ac30bcfc243647 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 1fea49c0c9a928e7017aeeab3107396556180e8c629b9d8e660681e342c13ada | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 2167686be54df45420f3ac91c75a16a2dfeb0bf785087d7f78e0ac7acad49bf6 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | d1f0bb8bb29ac2cf831b28143a15f88006a1645f3f9daa413d061b9e5af50171 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 4f2a69dacbed39cfdde57dbd7e5497b6eae672658d5c2e790fc896f9a919ca13 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
